units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
lattice bcc 1 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units box
create_box 1 whole
mass 1 92.906
region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 55 75 units box
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz
velocity all create 300 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix thermostat all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix thermostat
velocity projectile ramp 0 0 0 0 -20 -20 z sum yes
fix integrator all nve
run 100000
